<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10572] MVCC TX: Possible race on invokeAll operations</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10572</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;see&#160;&lt;tt&gt;GridNearTxEnlistFuture#checkResponse&lt;/tt&gt; method.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1) race on result creation - two threads may see &lt;tt&gt;this.res == null&lt;/tt&gt; and just set their values, result is partially lost&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2) race on success flag set - just set false flag may be overwritten by concurrent successful response checking operation.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
